    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "what do you mean \"no need to pretend\"? it just feels so heavy. staring at the wall, knowing i've got nothing left to contribute, nothing to ever give anyone again. it's like i'm just an empty vessel waiting for something that's never coming back. it feels like a waste, honestly. just staying here, being this nothingness.",
